AU  - McMullen, Curtis T.
TI  - Braid groups and Hodge theory
DA  - D:20201116
AB  - This paper gives an account of the unitary representations of the braid group that arise via the Hodge theory of cyclic branched cover- ings of P1, highlighting their connections with ergodic theory, complex reﬂection groups, moduli spaces of 1-forms and open problems in sur- face topology.
